{"2143690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TooneQuest", "steam_appid": 2143690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TooneQuest is a <strong>Creature Collection game</strong>. You must explore the islands and discover the whereabouts of the Toones, but once you do, you must capture them by succeeding in a test of skill and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go explore, take those leaps of faith, but know you will quickly return safely from any misadventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f8cf5e5d3e5817d9b4b14f51c5a2061f.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=574 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f8cf5e5d3e5817d9b4b14f51c5a2061f.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f8cf5e5d3e5817d9b4b14f51c5a2061f.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start your adventure on Omphalos, the island of eternal day. This magical place is not just where you start, but also the center of your adventure. Return when you have earned an Ability upgrade and use that new ability to navigate to another island's Portal gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/6cf231821e77e31daf9a1e51d156047a.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=696 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/6cf231821e77e31daf9a1e51d156047a.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/6cf231821e77e31daf9a1e51d156047a.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is also where you capture your companion Toone, Serenity. They will accompany you on your journey and light up your life when things get too dark.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f130a78ae606bcf74c31993212d569ad.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=706 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f130a78ae606bcf74c31993212d569ad.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f130a78ae606bcf74c31993212d569ad.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While searching for the Toones, you will pass many vistas and beautiful landmarks. However every island has its own inimical flavour and feel. Trees can hide the more shy Toones, or perhaps they are hiding behind giant boulders in unforeseen canyons? Some Toones are not shy at all and you can see them proudly bouncing up and down in the distance, only then you have to figure out how to get to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/e851d3d35039c26af0e1f1938cab5f82.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=384 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/e851d3d35039c26af0e1f1938cab5f82.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/e851d3d35039c26af0e1f1938cab5f82.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start, you can run, so run swiftly to capture your first Toones. Once you have caught enough you will earn an Ability. To get the ability, simply go back to Omphalos and collect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities such as Jump, Crawl, Double jump and Glide can be earned by the hardened adventurer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/3e63b10b180c2f2fb4ec60ef64326cb3.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=678 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/3e63b10b180c2f2fb4ec60ef64326cb3.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/3e63b10b180c2f2fb4ec60ef64326cb3.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When exploring the islands you will come across some Food. In fact there is lots of food on each island and to obtain Completion, you must collect not only all the Toones, but also all the Food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/4a248a934344f7e712a367fde4db08ba.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=792 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/4a248a934344f7e712a367fde4db08ba.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/4a248a934344f7e712a367fde4db08ba.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We sincerely hope you enjoy the journey in this game, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Enders Workshop</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TooneQuest is a <strong>Creature Collection game</strong>. You must explore the islands and discover the whereabouts of the Toones, but once you do, you must capture them by succeeding in a test of skill and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go explore, take those leaps of faith, but know you will quickly return safely from any misadventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f8cf5e5d3e5817d9b4b14f51c5a2061f.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=574 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f8cf5e5d3e5817d9b4b14f51c5a2061f.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f8cf5e5d3e5817d9b4b14f51c5a2061f.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start your adventure on Omphalos, the island of eternal day. This magical place is not just where you start, but also the center of your adventure. Return when you have earned an Ability upgrade and use that new ability to navigate to another island's Portal gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/6cf231821e77e31daf9a1e51d156047a.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=696 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/6cf231821e77e31daf9a1e51d156047a.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/6cf231821e77e31daf9a1e51d156047a.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is also where you capture your companion Toone, Serenity. They will accompany you on your journey and light up your life when things get too dark.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f130a78ae606bcf74c31993212d569ad.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=706 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f130a78ae606bcf74c31993212d569ad.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/f130a78ae606bcf74c31993212d569ad.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While searching for the Toones, you will pass many vistas and beautiful landmarks. However every island has its own inimical flavour and feel. Trees can hide the more shy Toones, or perhaps they are hiding behind giant boulders in unforeseen canyons? Some Toones are not shy at all and you can see them proudly bouncing up and down in the distance, only then you have to figure out how to get to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/e851d3d35039c26af0e1f1938cab5f82.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=384 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/e851d3d35039c26af0e1f1938cab5f82.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/e851d3d35039c26af0e1f1938cab5f82.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start, you can run, so run swiftly to capture your first Toones. Once you have caught enough you will earn an Ability. To get the ability, simply go back to Omphalos and collect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities such as Jump, Crawl, Double jump and Glide can be earned by the hardened adventurer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/3e63b10b180c2f2fb4ec60ef64326cb3.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=678 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/3e63b10b180c2f2fb4ec60ef64326cb3.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/3e63b10b180c2f2fb4ec60ef64326cb3.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When exploring the islands you will come across some Food. In fact there is lots of food on each island and to obtain Completion, you must collect not only all the Toones, but also all the Food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/4a248a934344f7e712a367fde4db08ba.poster.avif?t=1783759627\" width=792 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/4a248a934344f7e712a367fde4db08ba.webm?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/extras/4a248a934344f7e712a367fde4db08ba.mp4?t=1783759627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We sincerely hope you enjoy the journey in this game, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Enders Workshop</p>", "short_description": "An exploring and capture game. Find and capture all the unique creatures hiding on the 5 islands. Discover Abilities such as Jump, Crawl, Glide and Double-jump to help you explore.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/9105b6a7625dbbac4553b6d470d88bade53f8311/header.jpg?t=1783759627", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/2a15bf6ec5063084b48c2ab633bf046b283c658e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783759627", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143690/2a15bf6ec5063084b48c2ab633bf046b283c658e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783759627", "website": "http://www.endersworkshop.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 @ 2.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nvidia geforce rtx 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Lowest GPU/CPU tested on. Could go lower spec perhaps.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><st